  "description": "QUALITY. COMFORT. PERFORMANCE. STYLE. E-Trekking has been one of the strongest segments in the KTM portfolio for many years. With MACINA GRAN, MACINA STYLE and MACINA TOUR, the trekking range offers three distinct characters for different riding needs – all united by the same commitment to quality, comfort and reliable performance. The MACINA GRAN, with its wide 60 mm tires, is all about maximum comfort and a confident ride. Plenty of grip and additional cushioning make it the ideal companion for long tours and changing surfaces. All GRAN models are powered by the Bosch Performance Line CX drive unit combined with an 800 Wh PowerTube – providing plenty of power and range for extended rides. All three model ranges are built around a robust aluminium frame with clean integration and modern trekking geometry. For convenient battery handling, KTM once again relies on its proven POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system, allowing the battery to be easily removed upwards from the downtube and just as effortlessly reinserted.",
